# Time-boxed exceptions for the Keycloak image scan only (ADR-018 security gate). Entries expire so the
# deploy gate fails again and forces a re-check; the fix for a real upstream issue is a Keycloak patch
# release, not a longer expiry. Owner: platform engineering. Re-check every Keycloak 26.7.x release.
#
# 2026-10-02, Keycloak 26.7.5: the FreeMarker (CVE-2026-84939), Netty SNI (CVE-2026-75595), Bouncy Castle
# (CVE-2026-8763, CVE-2026-13506), and jackson-databind (CVE-2026-68497) exceptions were removed. 26.7.5
# bundles FreeMarker 2.3.35, Netty 4.1.138, Bouncy Castle 1.86.1, and jackson-databind 2.21.6 (Quarkus
# 3.33.4), all at or above the fixed versions.

# SQL Server JDBC driver: Keycloak bundles mssql-jdbc 13.2.1.jre11, which is the patched release in
# GHSA-m494-w24q-6f7w (vulnerable: 13.2.0 to before 13.2.1); the scanner still reports it. We use
# PostgreSQL only (KC_DB=postgres) and the driver is never loaded. Re-checked 2026-10-02.
CVE-2025-59250 exp:2027-01-26
